<p>Dear Tom,</p>
<p>Thank you for your interest in the Thornbury pumping station upgrade.
Before we can share the hydraulic models and site surveys, we need Kestrel
to sign our standard confidentiality agreement, which is attached.</p>
<p>Please return a signed copy by Friday 30 October so that we can include
Kestrel in the early supplier engagement sessions starting in November. Our
agreement is not normally open to negotiation, but please let me know if
you have any questions.</p>
<p>Kind regards,</p>
<p>Mark Ostrow<br>
Procurement Manager, Capital Delivery<br>
Halden Water Ltd<br>
T +44 1632 960214</p>
